     1	# Bounded live-state successor design
     2	
     3	REPORT-v2.md contains the corrected, proposed design. REPORT.md and
     4	REPORT-CORRECTION.json preserve the earlier wording and correction. The
     5	proposal is source inspection and does not implement or approve a new verifier.
     6	
     7	REGISTRATION.json and the extension registrations identify the time-bound
     8	source and record windows. READ-RECEIPT.json preserves an initially truncated
     9	output and a prior general-scope privacy registration, including the later
    10	exact registered rereads. NAVIGATION-RESULTS.json and TREE-INVENTORY.json are
    11	bounded metadata, not complete dynamic-dependency or source-body credit.
    12	
    13	`verify-packet.py --git-repo <publication-repository>` compares selected
    14	source bytes and the full tree listing to the specified commit without running
    15	product code or any historical evidence driver. The recorded run used local
    16	Git objects. The full historical snapshot and all referenced input objects are
    17	not copied into this packet; the listing and Git identity support recovery
    18	only while those objects remain available.
